# Regenerated scanner replay dumps. The default-tag run rewrites a byte-identical copy of the
# BEFORE/AFTER evidence on every execution, and the Poland corpus dump is ~23 000 lines; the .md
# summaries carry the conclusions. Only small, decisive evidence belongs in the repository.
reports/scan-import-v2/RESCUE_REPLAY_replay_*.json
reports/scan-import-v2/PL_POLAND_REPLAY_*.json
